  "result": "Done! I've added comprehensive payment recording functionality:\n\n**Created src/payments.js:**\n- `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` - Record a payment on an invoice\n  - Validates invoice status is 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n  - Validates amount is positive integer (cents)\n  - Prevents overpayment\n  - Creates/appends to payments array\n  - Auto-updates status:\n    - 'partially_paid' if balance remains\n    - 'paid' if fully paid\n  - Never mutates input\n- `balanceDue(invoice)` - Calculate remaining balance\n  - Returns total - sum of payments, clamped to 0\n\n**Added error codes:**\n- NOT_ISSUED: \"Invoice must be issued or partially paid to record a payment.\"\n- OVERPAYMENT: \"Payment exceeds the remaining balance due.\"\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- Overpayment is rejected (exact or underpayment only)\n- Status transitions: draft \u2192 issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid\n- Can only record payments on issued or partially_paid invoices\n- Multiple payments supported with running balance\n\n**Tests added:** 12 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Balance calculations (no payments, partial, full)\n- Payment validation (status, amount)\n- Overpayment rejection\n- Status transitions\n- Multiple payment sequences\n- No input mutation\n- Payments array creation\n\n**All 133 tests pass** \u2713",
